# Testing — agent reference

Canonical plan: **`docs/workflow/done/sitewide-automated-testing.md`**. How-to: **`docs/guides/testing/README.md`**. Skill: **`testing`**.

## Pyramid (default for every feature change)

| Layer            | Tool                                          | When                                                       |
| ---------------- | --------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| Unit (UI)        | Vitest Node (`ui/src/**/*.test.ts`)           | Pure logic: validators, workflow mirrors, plan/RBAC, dates |
| Unit (edge)      | Deno (`supabase/functions/_shared/*_test.ts`) | State machines, entitlements, orchestrator branches        |
| Handler          | Deno (`supabase/functions/tests/*.test.ts`)   | Edge handlers with branching (mock DB)                     |
| E2E mocked       | Playwright (`ui/e2e/features/<domain>/`)      | User journeys: routing + mocked API + auth seam            |
| Manual / `@live` | `docs/guides/testing/*-manual.md`             | PayMongo, OAuth, OTP email, Meta, Resend inbound           |

**Do not** E2E every field or modal. **Do not** use Playwright MCP as the regression suite (MCP is for exploration while writing specs).

## Where files live

```
ui/src/<feature>/lib/foo.test.ts
supabase/functions/_shared/foo_test.ts
supabase/functions/tests/<topic>.test.ts
ui/e2e/shared/          # authSeam, interceptEdge, ids
ui/e2e/features/<domain>/
```

No Playwright specs under `ui/src/`.

## Tags (Playwright describe title)

Every spec carries **exactly one** lane tag; `bun run check:e2e-lane-tags` fails on a missing or
duplicate tag, a committed `.only`, or a new `waitForTimeout`.

| Tag      | CI                                 |
| -------- | ---------------------------------- |
| `@smoke` | every PR + develop (3 viewports)   |
| `@ci`    | every PR + develop, sharded 4 ways |
| `@pwa`   | every PR (production build)        |
| `@live`  | never PR (nightly / manual)        |
| `@demo`  | never CI                           |

## Gates: what runs when

| Gate                       | Runs                                                                                         | Budget   |
| -------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- |
| `bun run test:fast`        | filenames, lane tags, types, lint, unit (node + dom)                                         | ~2.5 min |
| PR `ci.yml`                | guards, lint, types, unit + coverage floor, edge, build, `@smoke` 3 viewports, `@ci` sharded | ~10 min  |
| Deploy `ci-deploy-gate.sh` | guards, lint, types, unit + coverage, edge, build, `@critical` desktop                       | ~9 min   |
| `bun run ci:quality`       | everything, including the full `@ci` suite                                                   | ~40 min  |

`@critical` is a modifier on top of a lane tag, not a lane: it marks the money, tenancy,
workflow and access journeys that must also pass before a production deploy. Add it when an
acceptance line lands on money, booking status, cancellation, parking payment or RBAC.

## Same-change requirement

| Change                             | Test                                                                     |
| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| Pure helper / client-server mirror | Colocated unit (both sides if mirrored)                                  |
| Plan key or permission leaf        | Unit matrix + catalog drift test                                         |
| Workflow transition / side effect  | Deno `statusMachine` + orchestrator; E2E only if host click path changed |
| New primary page journey           | Route guide **Testing** row + `@smoke` if booking/auth/money path        |
| Mutating edge function             | Handler test or validator unit                                           |
| CSS / copy only                    | No new tests                                                             |
| Third-party integration            | Manual guide                                                             |

Update **`docs/guides/routes/*.md`** Testing column when the route guide changes.

## Commands

```bash
bun run test                  # Vitest UI
bun run test:edge             # Deno _shared
bun run test:edge:handlers    # Deno handler tests (no live/integration)
bun run test:e2e:smoke        # Playwright @smoke
bun run test:e2e:ci           # Playwright @ci (every PR, sharded)
bun run test:e2e:plans        # Plan tiers: public pricing, Plans page, gates, review dialog
bun run check:plan-catalog    # pricing_plans (local DB) vs golden tier matrix
bun run ci:quality            # Full PR parity
```

